  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: off-by-one out-of-bounds read in the meta (8BIM/IPTC) decoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-45358.patch: bound tag_length against the remaining\n       extent in GetIPTCStream in coders/meta.c\n     - CVE-2026-45358\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: missing dimension check in the DCM decoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-49218.patch: reject images decoded with zero rows or\n       columns in coders/dcm.c\n     - CVE-2026-49218\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: NULL pointer dereference in the distort operation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-53463.patch: require at least one argument before\n       reading arguments[0] in GenerateCoefficients in magick/distort.c\n     - CVE-2026-53463",
